cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these results, please cite them as below, together with the benchmark of D'Ambrosio et al. (2023)."
title: "CoPTS-KPFS results for the knapsack problem with forfeit sets"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "García"
    given-names: "José"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/rubincus/kpfs-copts-gpu-results"
abstract: >-
  Best solutions found for the 600 instances of the benchmark of the knapsack problem with forfeit sets and the
  60 KPFS-L instances, records of every run of the experiments of CoPTS-KPFS, a structure-guided cooperative tabu
  search with exact neighborhood evaluation on GPUs, reports of the analyses and a solution verifier.
keywords:
  - knapsack problem with forfeit sets
  - tabu search
  - GPU computing
  - benchmark results
  - combinatorial optimization
